cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use roofsight, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "RoofSight: Ground-View Roof and Rooftop-Obstacle Segmentation for On-Site PV Planning"
abstract: >-
  A dataset of ground-level photographs of residential roofs with instance masks for roof
  planes, rooftop obstacles, vegetation occlusion and roof edges; a benchmark with fixed
  splits; fine-tuned RF-DETR-Seg models exported to Core ML; and a Swift package that
  estimates pitch and azimuth per roof plane from one photo and the phone's pose.
authors:
  - family-names: Ulupinar
    given-names: Bünyamin
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/bnymnDev/roofsight
keywords:
  - photovoltaics
  - roof segmentation
  - instance segmentation
  - dataset
  - benchmark
  - coreml
